---
// Default glyph for `kind: coffee` notes. Same drawing as the inline
// `Coffee.astro` vignette (cup, handle, saucer, two steam strokes) so
// the note glyph and the home page's "In the cup" icon read as one
// mark; keep the path data in sync if either changes.
//
// The vignette's paths live in a 30-unit box, where the sibling
// glyphs use 24, so two things differ from the vignette:
// - `stroke-width` is 1.75 (1.4 × 30/24), matching the siblings'
//   rendered line weight at the shared 22px size.
// - The viewBox is offset so the drawing (x 4.3–27.7, y 4.3–22.7 with
//   stroke) sits centred in the glyph box instead of baseline-anchored
//   like the vignette.
// Static: the steam loop is scoped to `.inline-vignette`.
---

<svg viewBox="1 -1.5 30 30" width="22" height="22" role="img" aria-label="coffee glyph">
  <title>coffee</title>
  <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round">
    <path d="M5 22 L 25 22"></path>
    <path d="M7 12 L 9 22 L 21 22 L 23 12 Z"></path>
    <path d="M23 14 q 4 0 4 4 q 0 4 -4 4"></path>
    <path d="M12 8 q 0 -3 2 -3 q 2 0 2 3"></path>
    <path d="M17 8 q 0 -3 2 -3 q 2 0 2 3"></path>
  </g>
</svg>
